Transaction Layer
The Transaction Layer, TL, is implemented as a ovm_driver, svt_pcie_tl. The TL contains 
a configuration object, svt_pcie_tl_configuration (see Transaction Layer Configuration), 
a service sequencer (see Transaction Layer Sequencer and Sequences), which work 
together to setup and control the behavior of the TL. Additionally, the TL offers callbacks 
with exception capability (see Transaction Layer Callbacks and Exceptions), as well as a 
status object Transaction Layer Status.
